{# docs/adr/0108, D6 item 2: call an imported algorithm that writes a map in
   place, lent to it whole, and store what it answers where `location` names a
   variable. The statement is lowered ahead of the template by
   `forge::static_lowering` (`StaticTarget::in_place_call`), which holds the
   call's adapter and the place its answer goes, and stored on
   `action.native_code`. The algorithm cannot fail; an argument that fails
   ends its block before the call is made, as any element that raised does
   (W3C SCXML 4.9). #}
{% import 'actions/_native_statement.rs.jinja2' as native %}
// docs/adr/0108: <sce:call expr="{{ action.expr }}">
{{ native.emit(action, in_action_block is defined and in_action_block) }}
